message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "marEx: Scalable Detection and Tracking of Weather & Climate Extremes"
abstract: "A high-performance Python framework for computing climatologies and anomalies, identifying extremes, and tracking them through time in exascale weather and climate datasets. The anomaly and climatology stage is usable on its own, and every stage applies equally to ocean, atmosphere, land surface, and biogeochemical variables on regular grids and unstructured meshes."
